t this man is a  wonderful heart surgeon but unless they  seek it out in continuing education most  MDS are given very little formal  training on nutrition and we can't fault  them at that but I do expect better  interpretation of health research and  data and while most readers might see a  citation or an authoritative claim made  by a doctor and accepted as gospel I  hope my analysis has shown that not all  research is created equal the  recommendations of this diet are not  only largely based on mere Theory but  most of it doesn't even make theoretical  sense so bottom line eliminating lectins  from your diet is not going to magically  cure you of all that ails you as Dr  Grundy likes to say eating a balanced  diet that includes a wide range of  mostly minimally processed foods is a  far more sustainable and supportive  choice I hope my videos have helped you  think more critically about the  information that you see on online and  remember if it sounds too good to be  true even if it's coming from a doctor  unfortunately it probably is so on that  note that's all that I have for you guys  today if you liked it be sure to give it  the thumbs up leave me a comment below  on what you'd like to see me review next  subscribe to the channel and I'll see  you next time on Abby's kitchen bye  [Music]

